                transliteration = "Subhanallah (33 times), Alhamdulillah (33 times), Allahu Akbar (33 times) - La ilaha illallahu wahdahu la sharika lahu, lahul-mulku wa lahul-hamdu wa Huwa 'ala kulli shay'in Qadir.",
